summary:
  The title reader refuses a station whose certificate has only run out.

history:
  The player opens a station's address without checking its certificate, and
  the reader refused it once the dates had passed, so euddn's le0X stations
  played without titles or covers from 2026-10-23. The reader leaves only the
  dates unchecked.

target:
  package/contents/ui/reader.py

find:
      ctx.verify_flags |= _NO_CHECK_TIME

replace:
      ctx.verify_flags |= 0

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_reader_tls.py::test_a_title_behind_a_lapsed_certificate_comes_through.
  Line-neutral.
